look.com","description":"Free browser-based tools for developers, creators, PDF, image, ecommerce, and AI workflows. Fast online utilities with privacy-friendly local processing.","knowsAbout":["browser-based developer tools","client-side data processing","PDF workflow utilities","image optimization","AI-assisted productivity","ecommerce operations tools","technical writing for practical workflows"],"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"luowj1998@outlook.com","contactType":"customer support","availableLanguage":["English","Chinese"]},"publishingPrinciples":"https://toolorbit.site/about"},"inLanguage":"zh-CN"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"为什么有些卡片显示前一天或次日？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"因为工具比较的是同一时刻在不同时区的本地日期。目标时区比参考时区落后或超前较多时，本地日期会跨到前一天、次日，极端偏移还可能出现两天差。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"这个工具会自动处理夏令时吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"不会。它按固定 UTC 偏移计算，适合快速规划和解释时差。涉及纽约、伦敦、悉尼等会调整夏令时的地区时，请用当地当前规则复核。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"支持哪些非整点偏移？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"包含 UTC-09:30、UTC-03:30、UTC+03:30、UTC+04:30、UTC+05:30、UTC+05:45、UTC+06:30、UTC+08:45、UTC+09:30、UTC+10:30 和 UTC+12:45。"}}]}]0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"language":"zh","children":[["$","template",null,{"id":"structured-data-tool-world-timezone-compare","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$L4",null,null]}],["$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La"],"$Lb"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"bYYi-ZPGnf7tmCL1WLFhj"}
